    "Use tree DP. Let <code>dp0[u][r]</code> mean node <code>u</code> is not selected, and <code>dp1[u][r]</code> mean node <code>u</code> is selected, with subtree sum modulo <code>k</code> equal to <code>r</code>.",
    "Initialize <code>dp0[u][0] = 1</code> and <code>dp1[u][nums[u] % k] = 1</code>.\r\nWhen merging child <code>v</code>: if <code>u</code> is selected, merge only with <code>dp0[v]</code>; otherwise merge with <code>dp0[v] + dp1[v]</code>.",
    "Finally return <code>dp0[0][0] + dp1[0][0] - 1</code>, subtracting the empty subset."
